{"id":"7994defd-0fc4-4a97-9551-243b31aff080","createdAt":"2026-10-27T05:19:07.067Z","batchId":"settings_step-3-7-flash-gateway_low","approach":"html","modelId":"step-3.7-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"settings","prompt":"An account settings panel with profile, notifications and privacy sections.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<style>\n  .btn-ghost.active {\n    background-color: var(--tab-active-bg, #e2e8f0);\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  input, textarea, select {\n    width: 100%;\n    padding: 0.5rem;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e2e8f0);\n    border-radius: 0.25rem;\n    margin-top: 0.25rem;\n    font-family: inherit;\n  }\n  label > span:not(.badge) {\n    margin-left: 0.5rem;\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <div>\n    <h1>Account Settings</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Manage your profile, notification preferences, and privacy controls.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row gap-sm\" id=\"settings-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn-ghost active\" data-tab=\"profile\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">Profile</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" data-tab=\"notifications\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Notifications</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" data-tab=\"privacy\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Privacy & Security</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <div data-tab-content=\"profile\" class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title row between center\">\n      <span>Public Profile</span>\n      <span class=\"badge\">Verified</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">This information is visible to other users on the platform.</p>\n    <div class=\"row gap-lg\" style=\"align-items: flex-start;\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px; font-size: 2rem; display: grid; place-items: center;\">JD</div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"flex: 1;\">\n        <div>\n          <label>Display Name <input type=\"text\" value=\"Jane Doe\"></label>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <label>Username <input type=\"text\" value=\"@janedoe\"></label>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <label>Bio <textarea rows=\"2\">Product designer based in San Francisco. Lover of coffee and open source.</textarea></label>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <label>Email Address <input type=\"email\" value=\"jane@example.com\"></label>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Last updated 3 days ago</p>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n          <button class=\"btn\">Save Changes</button>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Cancel</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div data-tab-content=\"notifications\" class=\"card\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Notifications</div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">Select how and when you want to receive updates from us.</p>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-md\">\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n          <span>Email notifications</span>\n        </label>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Receive product updates, security alerts, and community messages via email.</p>\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n          <span>Push notifications</span>\n        </label>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Get real-time alerts in your browser or mobile app.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-md\">\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n          <span>Product updates</span>\n        </label>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">News about new features, improvements, and upcoming events.</p>\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input type=\"checkbox\">\n          <span>Marketing emails</span>\n        </label>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Promotional offers, partner news, and survey requests.</p>\n        <label>\n          <span>Digest frequency</span>\n          <select>\n            <option>Daily</option>\n            <option selected>Weekly</option>\n            <option>Never</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div data-tab-content=\"privacy\" class=\"card\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Privacy & Security</div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">Control your account visibility, data sharing, and security settings.</p>\n    <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"stat-label\">Profile Visibility</p>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"radio\" name=\"visibility\" checked>\n            <span>Public</span>\n          </label>\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"radio\" name=\"visibility\">\n            <span>Friends Only</span>\n          </label>\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"radio\" name=\"visibility\">\n            <span>Private</span>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <hr>\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n        <div class=\"stack gap-md\">\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n            <span>Show activity status</span>\n            <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Enabled</span>\n          </label>\n          <p class=\"small muted\">Let others see when you're online or last active.</p>\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n            <span>Enable two-factor authentication</span>\n            <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Enabled</span>\n          </label>\n          <p class=\"small muted\">Add an extra layer of security to your account login.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-md\">\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\">\n            <span>Share anonymous usage data</span>\n          </label>\n          <p class=\"small muted\">Help us improve the platform by sharing non-identifiable usage metrics.</p>\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\">\n            <span>Allow search engines to index my profile</span>\n          </label>\n          <p class=\"small muted\">Make your public profile discoverable via Google and other search engines.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <hr>\n      <div class=\"row between center\">\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Account created October 12, 2021</p>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Download My Data</button>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-destructive\">Delete Account</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n    const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('#settings-tabs .btn');\n    const contents = document.querySelectorAll('[data-tab-content]');\n    tabs.forEach(tab => {\n      tab.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        const target = tab.dataset.tab;\n        tabs.forEach(t => {\n          t.classList.remove('active');\n          t.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'false');\n        });\n        tab.classList.add('active');\n        tab.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'true');\n        contents.forEach(content => {\n          content.hidden = content.dataset.tabContent !== target;\n        });\n      });\n    });\n  });\n</script>","deltas":[[48418,"<style"],[48479,">\n "],[48489," .btn-"],[48489,"ghost.active {\n"],[48506,"    backg